      "storyTitle": "Figure: Akhenaten",
      "slideIndex": 3,
      "contentSummary": "Text:After his death, subsequent pharaohs — including his own son Tutankhamun — dismantled everything Akhenaten had built. His name was struck from official records; he was referred to only as \"the enemy\" or \"the criminal of Amarna.\"",
